messages:
Let me introduce myself again.
I am a Subway Boss, Ingo!{be01}
Well, there is nothing else to say
for the person who comes{be00}
all the way here.{be01}
Let's have the greatest battle,
better than ever before.

We, Ingo and Emmet, are a
two-car train.{be01}
This time, we were able to work toward
a victory.{be01}
Well, will you stop here?
Or will you challenge us again?{be01}
It's up to you.
But let me say one thing.{be01}
There is no terminal called End
in your life!

Bravo!!
Really excellent!{be01}
The best combination of
you and your Pokémon.{be00}
It is incredible!{be01}
When you and someone else combine,
your engine powers something special!{be01}
If you like, please challenge us
with a different combination.
